    "detailed_description": "Electronic wooden fish can represent a desire for life.<br>It can be tapped while working, placed there while studying, or hung while playing other games.<br>While running this executable file, one can expect it to actually be implemented.<br>For the wish to come true, please keep hitting it.<br><strong> Custom statements can be entered, and the length of the statement has no word limit </strong>. For example, you can input:<br>I hope my roommate's snoring can be cured this year.<br>I hope my family is in good health.<br>I hope my roommate is a reasonable person.<br>I hope my mother recovers soon.<br>I hope she/he is still happy.<br>I hope XX will gradually fall in love with me.<br>I hope to pass the exam.<br>I hope to be in good healt",
